# el1011-q-seq AM (2026-10-11, coordinator decision): fpm AUD 33975 = SC build 1207 + 32768: p_am registered at the ctlm pin (routed p_am -> argmax -58 ps,
# textbook class 3); argmax loop +1 cycle (tv / u_ttag / accumulator clear one edge longer; am_* / mx_* / idle one edge later). Same kit as fpa_sc.
# el1011-q-seq SC rebuild (2026-10-11, from fpapk-4e9afc303 routed TT -151.78 (fpa) / -251.36 (fpb)): AUD 1207 = AUD 183 + 1024 setup cuts, exact, 0 cycles:
# (a) u_pretag SRAM bank mux -> pre-scale compare (25-33 lv): line one edge shorter + register, nout-nb / nout-lb as kept KS in that stage, per-group kept compare vs pgi*K
# (b) ttag_q -> rotate -> mx_data: lane rotate / slot select pre-decoded from the ring output, rk[t_j] / rseen[t_j] registered with write forwarding
# (c) 3-operand scale_addr: offset added in the A->B stage (b_off), scale_addr = b_sbase + b_off (kept KS); (d) h_rd: 32 kept copies (32 ir bits each)
# p_am -> argmax (e, -58) unchanged: die-latency decision with qwendie-1011.
# el1011-q-seq PK rebuild (2026-10-11, from fpaau-1763e0919 post-CTS -533/-743): AUD 183 = AUD 55 + 128 exact prefix cuts
# (u_tt PK: land_cnt - ov_mark progress subtract as a kept KS, was a 15-MAJ ripple behind the land_cnt pin flop; u_ttag read
# from a register; controller FKS: argmax-merge 32-b compare + 18-b index add into the m_fidx/m_fval station as KS);
# regional ICG enables made at CTS by cloning the enable register per location group (cg_enrep_hook.tcl; the RTL's
# kept en_r copies are deleted by eliminate_dead_logic and the TT overlay drops OT_CG_ENREP); die 432.0 x 432.0 (was 777.6 / 648:
# 8.9% utilisation, 414 ps of wire from a pin flop to its consumer).  0 cycles vs AUD 55 (MEREG 3: +1 engine wake, as before).
# el1011-q-seq TEXTBOOK AUDIT rebuild (2026-10-11): top ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fpm (MEREG+RRG+PCUT+AUD): u_tt without the unobserved per-port x_re/x_addr (-62.7 k flops), tag delays u_tag (D~190, 2 banks) / u_pretag in 128x256 SRAM (-51.5 k flops), kv pin flops; re-sized die 777.6x777.6 (was 777.6x1814.4 for 130.7 k flops), macro_grid_place (20.16 um channels, 40 um margin), halo 20.16.
# el1011-q-seq (2026-10-11): qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fpa with top ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fpm (MEREG 1: me_mem_ok announced 2 edges ahead -> pin flop + kept enable flop drive u_me_cg / its CG-pushdown clones; was gating check -1,606 @770 from the raw input. RRG 1: 8 kept reset copies, the raw rst_n station users on the copies; was u_rs.rst_q -> 1.27 ns chain to 2,372 async clears and rst_n -> u_is1 -717). Die contract change posted in qwen lead log. 0 cycles inside the tile; the supply announces 2 edges early.
# fe-push-qwen-1010 (2026-10-10): qfd_tt_ctlm_i_a + PSRAM=1 + HQ2=1 via the wrapper top ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fp (no --param: yosys 0.68
# asserts on a re-processed parameterised ctlm_i top).  ctlm_i carries its own copy of the seq_su controller: the 64 x 1,024
# program-store flop array (65,536 flops; ctlm_i_{a,b}-955329f22 sat ~4 h in yosys) becomes two ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2
# macros with registered write pins, PRL 2 read timing kept; and the controller FIFO head is two words with a register-only fill
# enable (FQ_HEAD 2; the class that failed seq_su fba TT -131 / fbb post-CTS -537, closed to TT +95.26 in feb-f3e3d6b6f).
# 0 cycles (Verilator lockstep vs PSRAM 0 / HQ2 0, every output + prog_q every cycle; PMUT and HQ2=2 mutants FAIL).  RVT.
# qwen-1010/a: ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i (ICUT on the ME-side controller; ctlm_b PREROUTE -1,201 on u_ctrl_me.d_chase_rows -> issue)
# with the r22ko4 die pin plan: die control words E (M|E relay channel), band control W, VM words S, up4 selects N.
# redesign-qwen 2026-10-09: tree-top CONTROL tile WITH the ME-side controller (ot_qfd_tt_ctlm, generated by
# tools/redesign_qwen/split_ctrl.py emit-tile): ot_qfd_tt_ctl (AMR / SPRE) + ot_qwen_rom_core_ctrl_x OWN 1 + a 64 x 1,024-b
# program-store copy + the in-tile issue shell (DCU_M = DUC_M = 2).  The r22k 380-b issue / 98-b status bus over 37 relays
# each way is inside the tile; the die carries the token start, program writes, the SU / ME status snapshots, kvd_*.
# Sequencer / SU / VM-facing pins S, selects to the upper tiles N, port-element faces W / E.  Variant a: 777.6 x 1814.4.
TOP=ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fpm
SRCS='rtl/qwen_sys/rtl_finish_20261007/ot_qfd_sp_tree_top.sv rtl/qwen_sys/redesign_qwen/ot_qfd_tt_split.sv rtl/qwen_sys/lane_band_20261008/ot_qfd_band_lanes.sv rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/ot_qfd_spine_masters.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_me_spine_h_w12.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_delay.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_w12_arith.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_w12_matvec.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fastfp.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_add_lat.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_mul_lat.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_prefix.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fpu.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_mul_pipe.sv rtl/proto/ot_fp32_add_rne_pipe.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_sfu.sv rtl/qwen_sys/redesign_qwen/ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i.sv rtl/qwen_sys/redesign_qwen/ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fp.sv rtl/qwen_sys/redesign_qwen/ot_qfd_tt_ctlm_i_fpm.sv physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2_bb.v rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_dyn_ttiles.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_qwen_int8_embed_decode.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_cg.sv rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/ot_qfd_split_exact.sv physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_128x256_m1_r2c2/ot_sram_1r1w_128x256_m1_r2c2.v'
PARAMS=()   # module defaults (DCU_M = DUC_M = 2, XW 24, IS = OS = 1): yosys 0.68 asserts on a re-processed parameterised top
FW=432.0
FH=432.0
PINS=(--pin-region '^(clk|rst_n)$=top' --pin-region '^(t_sel_e|t_tv_e|up_fault)(\[|$)=top' --pin-region '^(p_\w+|fab_fault|scale_\w+|tr_fault)(\[|$)=left' --pin-region '^(x_rdy|x_dv|x_dc|x_dcs|x_dsp|mx_\w+|land_cnt|ov)(\[|$)=bottom' --pin-region '^(h_start|token|pos|prog_base|pw_\w+|x_o\w+|kv_ok|kv_write_drained|me_mem_ok|me_acc_o|me_idle_o|me_prog_o|m_f\w+|kvd_\w+|me_clk_en|c_fault)(\[|$)=right')
PIN_H='M4 M6'
PIN_V='M5 M7'
INTER='*'
REFGLOB='*u_is*'
FALSE_FROM='rst_n'
CLKPORT=clk
PD=0.45
NC=16
MACROS=(physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2 physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_128x256_m1_r2c2)
EXTRA=(--macro-view ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2=physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2 --macro-view ot_sram_1r1w_128x256_m1_r2c2=physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_128x256_m1_r2c2 --macro-place-halo 20.16 20.16 --orfs-var PDN_TCL=/src/physical/qwen_slab_m5/pdn_m5.tcl --orfs-var MACRO_PLACEMENT_TCL=/src/physical/qwen_die_masters/macro_grid_place_ctlm.tcl --step-tcl PRE_GLOBAL_PLACE=physical/qwen_die_masters/io_flop_at_pins.tcl --step-tcl PRE_DETAIL_PLACE=physical/qwen_die_masters/out_flop_release.tcl)
STAGES=synth,pnr

